CHAPTER.VERS:
Don't many [of you

          {+}
        ] be teachers, my brothers, knowing that we will receive heavier judgment.

Who is wise and understanding among you

          {+}
        ? Let him show, by his good life, his works in meekness of wisdom.

But if you

          {+}
         have bitter jealousy and faction in your

          {+}
         heart, don't glory and don't lie against the truth.
